{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794760599003,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd3ffeb90jQTuAVj0Ap9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e01165c6003Q04nkdNfxDmhwy","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd3ffeb90jQTuAVj0Ap9","messageID":"msg_1e0113249001sCq5aTG7OM8dGf","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a70d829cabdd1480","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-5.txt"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-5.txt, lines 1-1\n1: Code review pass five of command surfacing. Scope: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-scope-5.txt lists the changed files, one per line as area TAB path, the code this packet changed since review pass four's last fix (commit db14c22bb0) that still differs from origin/main. Review the files whose area equals your lineage label (last folder of config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir) without its -5 suffix, plus shared docs that describe them. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. Check: behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh and vibe; whether the advisor kill switch and the direct-call off switch stop every path they claim to stop and nothing else; whether a refusal, a question, a history statement or a mention of a command can still attach or start a mutating command; whether the transcript scorer counts a load, a followed step or an offer that did not happen, including Vibe journal records; whether the doctor wiring check reads hooks files correctly; holdout hygiene, so no tune, fix or report path reads or leaks holdout rows; docs, scenarios and changelogs that disagree with code. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl, holdout-prompts.jsonl or behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl except through jq del(.prompt), never run git diff, git show or git log -p on a path that includes command-prompts.jsonl without the pathspec exclusion for it, and never print a prompt whose split is holdout: counts only. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder. It never edits goal.md or any file outside its lineage folder.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-5.txt, lines 1-1\n1: Code review pass five of command surfacing. Scope: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-scope-5.txt lists the changed files, one per line as area TAB path, the code this packet changed since review pass four's last fix (commit db14c22bb0) that still differs from origin/main. Review the files whose area equals your lineage label (last folder of config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir) without its -5 suffix, plus shared docs that describe them. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. Check: behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh and vibe; whether the advisor kill switch and the direct-call off switch stop every path they claim to stop and nothing else; whether a refusal, a question, a history statement or a mention of a command can still attach or start a mutating command; whether the transcript scorer counts a load, a followed step or an offer that did not happen, including Vibe journal records; whether the doctor wiring check reads hooks files correctly; holdout hygiene, so no tune, fix or report path reads or leaks holdout rows; docs, scenarios and changelogs that disagree with code. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl, holdout-prompts.jsonl or behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl except through jq del(.prompt), never run git diff, git show or git log -p on a path that includes command-prompts.jsonl without the pathspec exclusion for it, and never print a prompt whose split is holdout: counts only. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder. It never edits goal.md or any file outside its lineage folder."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-5.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794760598982,"end":1794760599003}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794760599196,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd3ffeb90jQTuAVj0Ap9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e01165c6002hk2M9zd1oV1hH0","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd3ffeb90jQTuAVj0Ap9","messageID":"msg_1e0113249001sCq5aTG7OM8dGf","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-af4f105dde0537fb","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-metadata-5/ 2>&1; echo \"---BRIEF---\"; ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/ 2>&1"},"output":"total 8\ndrwx------@  8 michelkerkmeester  staff  256 Nov 15 17:36 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 28 michelkerkmeester  staff  896 Nov 15 17:36 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  2 michelkerkmeester  staff   64 Nov 15 17:36 .executor-state\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 15 17:36 containment\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff  224 Nov 15 17:36 deep-review-audit-ledger\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff  224 Nov 15 17:36 deep-review-effect-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  430 Nov 15 17:36 invocation-metadata.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 15 17:36 locks-and-fencing-v1\n---BRIEF---\ntotal 4352\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 44 michelkerkmeester  staff     1408 Nov 15 17:36 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 40 michelkerkmeester  staff     1280 Nov 15 17:34 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff     5057 Nov 13 20:41 deep-review-config.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      605 Nov 13 20:41 deep-review-fanout-config-pass-2.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      314 Nov 13 20:41 deep-review-fanout-config-pass-3.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      316 Nov 13 20:41 deep-review-fanout-config-pass-3b.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      312 Nov 13 20:41 deep-review-fanout-config-pass-3c.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      602 Nov 14 16:14 deep-review-fanout-config-pass-4.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   