egal convergence from `convergence.cjs` with all quality gates passing.\n- `maxIterationsReached` after iteration 4, with synthesis recording partial coverage honestly.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- [Direct claim-to-code verification]: reading the exact constant or function a doc names catches count drift and contradiction cheaply (iteration 1).\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- [None yet]: iteration 1 has no failed approach to record.\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n- None yet.\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: correctness, security, maintainability passes over the same 14 files\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- [Link rot across the nine scoped documents]: every relative markdown link resolves; no broken-target finding exists (iteration 1).\n- [Graph metadata drift]: `graph-metadata.json` intent signals and enhance edges match `runtime/scripts/skill-graph.json` exactly (iteration 1).\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: maintainability\n- Focus area: `runtime/tests/README.md` inventory and the playbook package structure; confirm 