{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794762056725,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd3ffeb90jQTuAVj0Ap9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e0279cd000140O6k3UPSZbnZq","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd3ffeb90jQTuAVj0Ap9","messageID":"msg_1e02787230014hln3t5c2obm0U","type":"tool","id":"call_ed80e61939c340a29820db8d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\nART=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-metadata-5\necho \"== report tail\"; tail -20 \"$ART/review-report.md\"\necho \"== state log types\"; node -e 'const fs=require(\"fs\");const rows=fs.readFileSync(process.argv[1]+\"/deep-review-state.jsonl\",\"utf8\").trim().split(\"\\n\").map(JSON.parse);console.log(rows.map(r=>r.type+\":\"+(r.iteration??r.event??\"\")).join(\"\\n\"));console.log(\"count\",rows.length);' \"$ART\"\nnode -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\");\nconst p=process.argv[1]+\"/deep-review-config.json\";\nconst c=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(p,\"utf8\"));\nc.status=\"complete\";\nfs.writeFileSync(p, JSON.stringify(c,null,2)+\"\\n\");\nconsole.log(\"config status\", c.status);\n' \"$ART\""},"output":"== report tail\n\n**Overlay Protocols**: `skill_agent` pass, `agent_cross_runtime` pass with the Codex/Cursor/Devin caveat, `feature_catalog_code` partial, `playbook_capability` partial.\n\n### Sources Reviewed\n\n- All 14 files listed in `review/review-scope-5.txt` under `docs-metadata`.\n- Code and artifacts read as evidence: `command-attach.ts`, `render.ts`, `fusion.ts`, `advisor-disabled.ts`, `skill-advisor-cli.ts`, `hook-flags.cjs`, `hook-flags.env.example`, `metrics.ts`, `post-dispatch-validate.ts` (gate shape), `score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, `command-bridges.generated.json`, `skill-advisor-launcher.cjs`, `prompt-advisor.mjs` (Vibe), `advisor-tool-schemas.ts`, `manual-testing-playbook.vitest.ts`, `leaf-scopes.json`, `graph-metadata.json`, `skill-graph.json` and the doctor playbook DOC-385..DOC-391 files.\n\n### Deviations and Limits\n\n- No prompt corpus was opened; holdout hygiene holds.\n- No file outside the lineage directory was written.\n- The packet lock was not acquired (harness-owned boundary).\n- Continuity save was not run (dispatch write boundary).\n- The Vibe journal scorer was checked by code path, not by scoring a live journal; the stored arm transcripts were not opened.\n- The load-rate finding is a documentation-definition finding; the scorer's number was not recomputed from an arm.\n\n### Rule Sources\n\nRule sources: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/references/review-core.md`. Overrides: none. Refused: none. Ignored: none. Conflicts: none.\n== state log types\nconfig:\niteration:1\nevent:claim_adjudication\niteration:2\nevent:claim_adjudication\niteration:3\nevent:claim_adjudication\niteration:4\nevent:claim_adjudication\nevent:iteration-4\nevent:synthesis_complete\ncount 11\nconfig status complete\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"== report tail\n\n**Overlay Protocols**: `skill_agent` pass, `agent_cross_runtime` pass with the Codex/Cursor/Devin caveat, `feature_catalog_code` partial, `playbook_capability` partial.\n\n### Sources Reviewed\n\n- All 14 files listed in `review/review-scope-5.txt` under `docs-metadata`.\n- Code and artifacts read as evidence: `command-attach.ts`, `render.ts`, `fusion.ts`, `advisor-disabled.ts`, `skill-advisor-cli.ts`, `hook-flags.cjs`, `hook-flags.env.example`, `metrics.ts`, `post-dispatch-validate.ts` (gate shape), `score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, `command-bridges.generated.json`, `skill-advisor-launcher.cjs`, `prompt-advisor.mjs` (Vibe), `advisor-tool-schemas.ts`, `manual-testing-playbook.vitest.ts`, `leaf-scopes.json`, `graph-metadata.json`, `skill-graph.json` and the doctor playbook DOC-385..DOC-391 files.\n\n### Deviations and Limits\n\n- No prompt corpus was opened; holdout hygiene holds.\n- No file outside the lineage directory was written.\n- The packet lock was not acquired (harness-owned boundary).\n- Continuity save was not run (dispatch write boundary).\n- The Vibe journal scorer was checked by code path, not by scoring a live journal; the stored arm transcripts were not opened.\n- The load-rate finding is a documentation-definition finding; the scorer's number was not recomputed from an arm.\n\n### Rule Sources\n\nRule sources: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/references/review-core.md`. Overrides: none. Refused: none. Ignored: none. Conflicts: none.\n== state log types\nconfig:\niteration:1\nevent:claim_adjudication\niteration:2\nevent:claim_adjudication\niteration:3\nevent:claim_adjudication\niteration:4\nevent:claim_adjudication\nevent:iteration-4\nevent:synthesis_complete\ncount 11\nconfig status complete\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\\nART=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-metadata-5\\necho \\\"== report tail\\\"; tail -20 \\\"$ART/review-report.md\\\"\\necho \\\"== state log types\\\"; node -e 'const fs=require(\\\"fs\\\");const rows=fs.readFileSync(process.argv[1]+\\\"/deep-review-state.jsonl\\\",\\\"utf8\\\").trim().split(\\\"\\\\n\\\").map(JSON.parse);console.log(rows.map(r=>r.type+\\\":\\\"+(r.iteration??r.event??\\\"\\\")).join(\\\"\\\\n\\\"));console.log(\\\"count\\\",rows.length);' \\\"$ART\\\"\\nnode -e '\\nconst fs=require(\\\"fs\\\");\\nconst p=process.argv[1]+\\\"/deep-review-config.json\\\";\\nconst c=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(p,\\\"utf8\\\"));\\nc.status=\\\"complete\\\";\\nfs.writeFileSync(p, JSON.stringify(c,null,2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\nconsole.log(\\\"config status\\\", c.status);\\n' \\\"$ART\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794762054864,"end":1794762056725}}}}
